{
  "$Comment": "Gingerbread Cookie, the first of the three Christmas treats: baked three at a time at a Chef's Stove (the Cookingbench, its Baked tab) once a player has learned it from Christmas_Recipe_Gingerbread_Cookie. It wears the game's gingerbread ornament (WinterHoliday_Ornament_Biscuit's model, texture and icon, which the game ships with no item of its own). Eating one gives an instant heal and Christmas_Food_Speed (15% faster for ten minutes); the game has no food that speeds a player up, so there is nothing of its own to clear first. Its description in items.lang writes the numbers out: change it with the effect. Recipe.Input is what one batch costs, Recipe.Output and OutputQuantity how many it makes (keep the two equal, as the game's salt does); Fuel is the 3 fuel every baked dish in the game burns. The cookie is good all year.",
